*** T09-bignum-rational — arbitrary-precision integer, exact rational, canonicalization, sign, and coercion probes
set show timing off .
load smt

fmod SMT-NUMBER-PROBES is
  pr REAL-INTEGER .
  vars I J : Integer .
  vars P Q : Real .
endfm

check I === 123456789012345678901234567890123456789 and I > 123456789012345678901234567890123456788 .
check 123456789012345678901234567890123456789 * I === 123456789012345678901234567890123456789 and I =/== 1 .
check 123456789012345678901234567890/98765432109876543210987654321 < P .
check P === 123456789012345678901234567890/98765432109876543210987654321 and P =/== 137174210/109739369 .
check P === -123456789012345678901234567890/98765432109876543210987654321 and P < -1/1 .
check toReal(123456789012345678901234567890123456789) === 123456789012345678901234567890123456789/1 .
